{"2101470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spellstruck", "steam_appid": 2101470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Magical Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/5ab24c79b3585dee491b61a27ffe2ecc.poster.avif?t=1772527861\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/5ab24c79b3585dee491b61a27ffe2ecc.webm?t=1772527861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/5ab24c79b3585dee491b61a27ffe2ecc.mp4?t=1772527861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spellstruck currently offers 8 elements designed to support every kind of mage, from aggressive powerhouses to tactical defenders and flashy risk-takers. Each element includes three spells: a curveable basic attack, a secondary, and a high-impact ultimate. Mix and match effects across elements to unleash creative, combo-driven chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/1cd4f1caed0f8b931a4d7d22ad4d3b6d.poster.avif?t=1772527861\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/1cd4f1caed0f8b931a4d7d22ad4d3b6d.webm?t=1772527861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/1cd4f1caed0f8b931a4d7d22ad4d3b6d.mp4?t=1772527861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spellstruck features familiar game modes alongside two unique twists that put its spell system to work in new ways. From straightforward elimination matches to tense battles where defending your own totem is just as important as destroying your opponent’s, each mode offers a distinct challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons and Buffs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/c8e45897390707bd2799a4b4ec3264b5.poster.avif?t=1772527861\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/c8e45897390707bd2799a4b4ec3264b5.webm?t=1772527861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/c8e45897390707bd2799a4b4ec3264b5.mp4?t=1772527861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect elemental buffs to gain speed, damage, and defensive boosts, or grab weapons for alternative ways to take down your opponent. Both spawn randomly across the arena and can be saved for a perfectly timed play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Customisation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/32a34169355585e48a5664003b189c22.poster.avif?t=1772527861\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/32a34169355585e48a5664003b189c22.webm?t=1772527861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/32a34169355585e48a5664003b189c22.mp4?t=1772527861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your mage with a growing collection of cosmetics, including outfits, armwear, pets, and weapons. Everything is unlocked through gameplay, so every new look is earned—not bought. As you play, you’ll also unlock new abilities, letting you evolve both your style and your toolkit over time.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Magical Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/5ab24c79b3585dee491b61a27ffe2ecc.poster.avif?t=1772527861\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/5ab24c79b3585dee491b61a27ffe2ecc.webm?t=1772527861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/5ab24c79b3585dee491b61a27ffe2ecc.mp4?t=1772527861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spellstruck currently offers 8 elements designed to support every kind of mage, from aggressive powerhouses to tactical defenders and flashy risk-takers. Each element includes three spells: a curveable basic attack, a secondary, and a high-impact ultimate. Mix and match effects across elements to unleash creative, combo-driven chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/1cd4f1caed0f8b931a4d7d22ad4d3b6d.poster.avif?t=1772527861\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/1cd4f1caed0f8b931a4d7d22ad4d3b6d.webm?t=1772527861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/1cd4f1caed0f8b931a4d7d22ad4d3b6d.mp4?t=1772527861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spellstruck features familiar game modes alongside two unique twists that put its spell system to work in new ways. From straightforward elimination matches to tense battles where defending your own totem is just as important as destroying your opponent’s, each mode offers a distinct challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons and Buffs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/c8e45897390707bd2799a4b4ec3264b5.poster.avif?t=1772527861\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/c8e45897390707bd2799a4b4ec3264b5.webm?t=1772527861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/c8e45897390707bd2799a4b4ec3264b5.mp4?t=1772527861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect elemental buffs to gain speed, damage, and defensive boosts, or grab weapons for alternative ways to take down your opponent. Both spawn randomly across the arena and can be saved for a perfectly timed play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Customisation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/32a34169355585e48a5664003b189c22.poster.avif?t=1772527861\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/32a34169355585e48a5664003b189c22.webm?t=1772527861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/extras/32a34169355585e48a5664003b189c22.mp4?t=1772527861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your mage with a growing collection of cosmetics, including outfits, armwear, pets, and weapons. Everything is unlocked through gameplay, so every new look is earned—not bought. As you play, you’ll also unlock new abilities, letting you evolve both your style and your toolkit over time.</p>", "short_description": "Face off in the ultimate showdown of elemental magic in Spellstruck. A game of tactical and reactive, arena style combat on randomised maps. Curve spells through the air, deflect attacks and combine an ever-growing list of unique abilities to defeat your rivals.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/40abb6e316760cb1dc2611d2f508ab71032977ce/header.jpg?t=1772527861", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/eb6ba6fed7bec76316e602cb12e64339b40a0b64/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772527861", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101470/eb6ba6fed7bec76316e602cb12e64339b40a0b64/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772527861", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8/10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3 2.4 GHz processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 video card<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<st